# Large datasets (exceed GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit)
#
# The old rule `Deep-Learning/creditcard.csv` never matched, because the file
# is at Deep-Learning/Project1/creditcard.csv. Five datasets totalling ~3.8 GB
# were staged as a result, which is why `git push` failed:
#
#   1.70 GB  Deep-Learning/rejected_2007_to_2018Q4.csv
#   1.60 GB  Deep-Learning/accepted_2007_to_2018Q4.csv
#    336 MB  Deep-Learning/lendingclubfull.parquet
#    144 MB  Deep-Learning/Project1/creditcard.csv
#     68 MB  Deep-Learning/lendingclub.parquet
#
# Matching by extension anywhere under Deep-Learning, so a file moving between
# folders cannot slip through the way creditcard.csv did.
Deep-Learning/**/*.csv
Deep-Learning/**/*.parquet

# Traditional-ML/bank-full.csv is 4.4 MB and stays tracked — small enough to
# keep the project reproducible.

# RAG mentor memory file (local only)
MENTOR_PROGRESS.md
